--  13 | tutorial_tuningparts | Special Chest 2    | toolbox_1 (reused)
--  14 | xpromo            | Fingersoft Chest      | toolbox_crosspromo, xpromoChestIndex=14
--  15 | mega              | Mega Chest            | mega_ad_chest
